{#-
  OpenVDM cruise README template (Jinja2, https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/).

  To change it, copy this file to server/etc/cruise_readme.md.j2 (or set
  cruiseReadme.template in openvdm.yaml) and edit the copy; OpenVDM uses this
  .dist file while there's no copy. The variables are described in
  build_cruise_readme_context() in server/lib/readme.py. The README is
  rebuilt whenever the cruise config is exported: Setup New Cruise, Edit
  Cruise, Finalize Cruise and Export OpenVDM Config.
-#}
# Cruise {{ cruise.cruiseID }}{% if cruise.cruiseName %}: {{ cruise.cruiseName }}{% endif %}


{% if cruise.cruiseDescription %}
{{ cruise.cruiseDescription }}

{% endif %}
This directory holds the data collected during cruise {{ cruise.cruiseID }}{% if vessel.name %} aboard {{ vessel.name }}{% endif %}, organized by OpenVDM (Open Vessel Data Management).

## Cruise

{% if vessel.name %}
- **Vessel:** {{ vessel.name }}{% if vessel.r2r and vessel.r2r.vesselID %} (R2R vessel ID {{ vessel.r2r.vesselID }}){% endif %}

{% endif %}
{% if cruise.cruisePI %}
- **Chief scientist:** {{ cruise.cruisePI }}
{% endif %}
{% if cruise.cruiseStartDate or cruise.cruiseEndDate %}
- **Dates:** {{ cruise.cruiseStartDate or "?" }} to {{ cruise.cruiseEndDate or "?" }}
{% endif %}
{% if cruise.cruiseStartPort or cruise.cruiseEndPort %}
- **Ports:** {{ cruise.cruiseStartPort or "?" }} to {{ cruise.cruiseEndPort or "?" }}
{% endif %}
{% if cruise.cruiseLocation %}
- **Location:** {{ cruise.cruiseLocation }}
{% endif %}
{% if cruise.cruiseExtent %}
- **Extent:** {{ cruise.cruiseExtent.westernmost }} to {{ cruise.cruiseExtent.easternmost }} longitude, {{ cruise.cruiseExtent.southernmost }} to {{ cruise.cruiseExtent.northernmost }} latitude (decimal degrees)
{% endif %}
{% if vessel.contact and (vessel.contact.institution or vessel.contact.email) %}
- **Contact:** {{ [vessel.contact.institution, vessel.contact.email] | select | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}

## Directory layout
Paths are relative to this directory.
{# Each line of a description ends in two spaces, a Markdown line break, so
   its Source/Contents, Files and Sub-directories lines (#449) stay apart #}

### `{{ files.readme }}`: this file.
### `{{ files.cruise_config }}`: the cruise's OpenVDM configuration (JSON): the cruise details above and the directory layout.
### `{{ files.md5_summary }}`: the MD5 checksum of every file in this directory, to check that a copy of it is complete and unchanged.
### `{{ files.md5_summary_md5 }}`: the MD5 checksum of `{{ files.md5_summary }}` itself.
{% if files.data_dashboard_manifest %}
### `{{ files.data_dashboard_manifest }}`: the list of the files behind OpenVDM's Data Dashboard: the data and quality test results extracted from the raw files.
{% endif %}

